7. Limitations
• Data is lost when the program closes (no file or database storage)
• No input validation: non-numeric marks crash the program and out-of-range marks are
accepted
• Duplicate names overwrite earlier records
• No option to edit or delete a student
8. Future Scope
• Save data to a file or database
