• Add edit and delete features
• Show highest and lowest marks and grade distribution
• Build a GUI or web version
9. Conclusion
The project applies core Python concepts such as functions, dictionaries, loops and
conditional statements to build a working menu-driven grade management tool. It provides a
base that can be extended with persistent storage and validation.